	"_comment_celebrations": "Presentation-only milestone celebrations (no coins, no theme or music change): 'short' = MILESTONE stamp + bursts; 'strong' = more bursts + a longer 'N LEVELS!' stamp; 'major' = 'N LEVELS ESCAPED!' fitted overlay + the biggest burst (300 - not a finale). Levels 125 / 150 / 175 keep their own milestone_levels behaviour (look, music and their one-time bonus). Since the 1-300 freeze, 25 / 50 / 75 / 100 use the approved Experience Lab tiers ('lab_milestone*' = 'N LEVELS ESCAPED!' overlay; 'lab_major' at the Master Level 100). Since the milestone polish EVERY 25th level uses that same presentation (overlay + 'N LEVELS ESCAPED!' card): 'lab_milestone' / '_strong' / '_plus' repeat every 75 levels, 100 and 200 are 'lab_major' (then the MASTER / GRAND MASTER stamp), 300 'major'. Rewards are separate and unchanged: the Master bonuses (100, 200) and the milestone_levels bonus (125 / 150 / 175).",
